{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09626","headline":"因假归白阁西草堂 · 岑参","name":"因假归白阁西草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷声傍太白，雨在八九峰。\n东望白阁云，半入紫阁松。\n胜概纷满目，衡门趣弥浓。\n幸有数亩田，得延二仲踪。\n早闻达士语，偶与心相通。\n误徇一微官，还山愧尘容。\n钓竿不复把，野碓无人舂。\n惆怅飞鸟尽，南谿闻夜钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}